{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id572197690"}, "name":{"label":"Cong VN"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-04-26T09:10:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.57.0"}, "id":{"label":"7266662295"}, "title":{"label":"No prompt for same date booking"}, "content":{"label":"At 3:05 PM Apr 23, 2021, I booked 5 tickets for Ba Na Hill, option [QR Code Direct Entry] Admission Ticket + Lunch Voucher. \n\nI intented to book for date Apr 24, 2021.\n\nBecause lunch service stops at 3:00 PM everyday, so at the time I booked (3:05 PM), I thought that the earliest available date is Apr 24, 2021. I selected earliest date. But it really was Apr 23, 2021. And I couldn’t use these tickets (wrong date).\n\nWhy the lunch voucher was invalid at the time I booked (because lunch service stop at 3:00 PM) it was still available to be selected in the app?\n\nWhy Admission Ticket was only available until 5:PM of the same date that I booked (2 hours remaining) but the app didn’t show any prompt or warning?\n\nI contacted to customer service, and he said that “the amendment is unable because it’s an in-date request”.  Why the in-date request for date amendment is unable but the in-date booking does not show any warning?\n\nI really made a mistake when I didn’t check the booked date carefully. But if the app show some warning, maybe, I could recognize my mistake and correct it.\n\nI’m very disappointed about Klook’s App and Klook’s customer service.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=961850126&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
