{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id692183194"}, "name":{"label":"jubidah"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-04-07T10:08:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.55.1"}, "id":{"label":"7194967729"}, "title":{"label":"Very bad service"}, "content":{"label":"I don't know how Klook works on the other countries, but in my country (Viet Nam) you give disappointed at the first time I use your service.\nI place two orders for my family group. And I just recived one of these. When I ask for support after waiting the confirmation in 48 hours, what they said is just please understanding, please wait. How con you stay confident when you need the ticket to on board but they can't give you 24hours before boarding! How come!\nAnd I also had a live chat and email with Klook team. They promise to give me a refund if after 3PM they can not give me the tickets. But after that they still asking me to wait! And then I've waited and can't stand anymore so I ask them to cancel and refund. The supporter agree and said she will assist me with this.\nBut in the midnight, they sent me the email said that my order has confirmed\nOMG! What happened here???? I ask for cancel and bought tickets from other seller. Klook already confirmed that they would cancel my order, but they still send me the ticket after that, and there is no refund!\nPlease respect your customer.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=961850126&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
